      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Acute pancreatitis is a frequently serious abdominal condition. The cause remains unknown. Biliary tract diseases as well as alcohol are the most important etiological factors. Diagnostic measures, of help in the emergency situation, differential diagnosis and therapeutic procedures, which can be initiated in general practice, are discussed."},
